models.description:
Shopping cart entity representing a customer's active shopping session.

Stores the state of a customer's shopping activities, enabling persistent cart functionality across browser sessions and device changes. Each cart belongs to exactly one customer and contains items selected for potential purchase.

Carts are created implicitly when a customer adds their first item and persist for 30 days even when logged out. They serve as the container for shopping cart items and transition into orders during checkout.

The cart lifecycle includes creation through first item addition, updates through item modifications, and either conversion to orders or automatic cleanup after inactivity periods.

